#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:1
msgid "Pedosphere Theory"
msgstr "土壤圈过程理论"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:3
msgid "Scope, process inventory, and certificate map"
msgstr "范围、过程清单与证书映射"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:5
msgid "The RELIC pedosphere domain (`relic.scientific.pedosphere`) represents litter and soil organic carbon turnover, cross-sphere litterfall and hydrological chain maps, soil nitrogen mineralization, nitrification, denitrification, and leaching, root nitrogen and phosphorus uptake, diagnostic C:N stoichiometry auditing, wetland methane production, oxidation, three-pathway transport, and single-owner budget realization, as well as porous-media water, gas, solute, Freundlich index-1 equilibrium-sorption DAE, moving-domain ALE diffusion, and mobile-immobile two-region mass transfer (*Methods of Ecological Analysis*, Chapter 23)."
msgstr "RELIC 土壤圈领域（`relic.scientific.pedosphere`）刻画凋落物与土壤有机碳周转、跨圈层凋落物与水文链映射、土壤氮矿化、硝化、反硝化与淋溶、根系氮磷吸收、诊断性碳氮（C:N）化学计量审计、湿地甲烷产生、氧化、三通道输运与单一归属收支实现，以及多孔介质水分、气体、溶质输运、Freundlich 指标-1 平衡吸附微分代数方程（Differential-Algebraic Equation, DAE）、移动域任意拉格朗日-欧拉（Arbitrary Lagrangian-Eulerian, ALE）扩散与流动-不动双区质量传递（《生态学分析方法》，第 23 章）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:15
msgid "Twenty-four concrete scientific Functors reside in `relic.scientific.pedosphere`, each paired with an `IPHSEquivalenceCertificate` spanning `Level 1` (`3` classes), `Level 2` (`13` classes), and `Level 3` (`8` classes):"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.pedosphere` 包含 24 个具体科学算子，每个算子均配有互连端口哈密顿系统（Interconnected Port-Hamiltonian System, IPHS）等价证书 `IPHSEquivalenceCertificate`，涵盖 `Level 1`（`3` 个类）、`Level 2`（`13` 个类）与 `Level 3`（`8` 个类）："

