#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:52
msgid "Five-pool observation and mutually exclusive decomposition closures"
msgstr "五库观测与互斥分解闭合"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:54
msgid "On the canonical five-pool areal carbon vector $\\mathbf{C} = (C_{\\mathrm{met}}, C_{\\mathrm{str}}, C_{\\mathrm{fast}}, C_{\\mathrm{slow}}, C_{\\mathrm{passive}})^{\\mathsf{T}}$ [g C m$^{-2}$], `CarbonPoolsFunctor` (`Level 1`) evaluates the per-cell total $C_{\\mathrm{total}}(c) = \\sum_i C_i(c)$ across the pool axis without summing across unequal-area grid cells or modifying stocks ($\\Delta \\mathbf{C} = \\mathbf{0}$)."
msgstr "在规范五库面积基准碳向量 $\\mathbf{C} = (C_{\\mathrm{met}}, C_{\\mathrm{str}}, C_{\\mathrm{fast}}, C_{\\mathrm{slow}}, C_{\\mathrm{passive}})^{\\mathsf{T}}$ [g C m$^{-2}$] 上，`CarbonPoolsFunctor`（`Level 1`）沿碳库维计算单网格总储量 $C_{\\mathrm{total}}(c) = \\sum_i C_i(c)$，不跨不等面积网格单元直接相加，也不修改碳储量（$\\Delta \\mathbf{C} = \\mathbf{0}$）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:60
msgid "A simulation graph selects **at most one** prognostic decomposition owner for a given soil carbon support (Parton et al., 1987; Coleman and Jenkinson, 1996; Wieder et al., 2013):"
msgstr "对于给定的土壤碳支撑域，同一仿真图**至多选择一个**预报分解归属算子（Parton et al., 1987；Coleman and Jenkinson, 1996；Wieder et al., 2013）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:64
msgid "**Compartment matrix (`PoolsMatrix`, `Level 2`)**: with diagonal turnover matrix $K$ [s$^{-1}$], column-sub-stochastic transfer matrix $T$ ($T_{ij} \\ge 0$, $\\sum_i T_{ij} \\le 1$), environmental scalar $f_{\\mathrm{env}}$, and litter input vector $\\mathbf{I}$ [g C m$^{-2}$ s$^{-1}$],"
msgstr "**分室矩阵（`PoolsMatrix`，`Level 2`）**：设对角周转率矩阵为 $K$ [s$^{-1}$]、列次随机转移矩阵为 $T$（$T_{ij} \\ge 0$，$\\sum_i T_{ij} \\le 1$）、环境标量为 $f_{\\mathrm{env}}$、凋落物输入向量为 $\\mathbf{I}$ [g C m$^{-2}$ s$^{-1}$]，则"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:69
msgid "\\mathbf{D} = f_{\\mathrm{env}} K \\mathbf{C}, \\qquad \\frac{\\mathrm{d}\\mathbf{C}}{\\mathrm{d}t} = (T - I_d)\\mathbf{D} + \\mathbf{I}, \\qquad R_{\\mathrm{hetero}} = \\mathbf{1}^{\\mathsf{T}}(I_d - T)\\mathbf{D},"
msgstr "\\mathbf{D} = f_{\\mathrm{env}} K \\mathbf{C}, \\qquad \\frac{\\mathrm{d}\\mathbf{C}}{\\mathrm{d}t} = (T - I_d)\\mathbf{D} + \\mathbf{I}, \\qquad R_{\\mathrm{hetero}} = \\mathbf{1}^{\\mathsf{T}}(I_d - T)\\mathbf{D},"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:71
msgid "satisfying the exact open carbon ledger $\\sum_i \\Delta C_i + R_{\\mathrm{hetero}}\\Delta t - \\sum_i I_i\\Delta t = 0$."
msgstr "严格满足开放碳收支账本 $\\sum_i \\Delta C_i + R_{\\mathrm{hetero}}\\Delta t - \\sum_i I_i\\Delta t = 0$。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:74
msgid "**Pool-resolved first-order kinetics (`FirstOrderDecomposition`, `Level 2`)**: replaces scalar $f_{\\mathrm{env}}K$ with pool-specific decay rates $D_i = k_i\\,f_T(T)\\,f_\\theta(\\theta)\\,f_{q,i}\\,C_i$ under $Q_{10}$ or Arrhenius thermal scaling and clay/lignin stabilization modifiers $f_{q,i}$, closing the same five-pool carbon and $R_{\\mathrm{hetero}}$ ledger."
msgstr "**分库一级动力学（`FirstOrderDecomposition`，`Level 2`）**：在 $Q_{10}$ 或 Arrhenius 温度标度及黏粒/木质素稳定化修正因子 $f_{q,i}$ 下，以分库衰减速率 $D_i = k_i\\,f_T(T)\\,f_\\theta(\\theta)\\,f_{q,i}\\,C_i$ 替代标量乘积 $f_{\\mathrm{env}}K$，并闭合同一五库碳储量与 $R_{\\mathrm{hetero}}$ 账本。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:80
msgid "**Reverse Michaelis-Menten microbial-enzyme kinetics (`MicrobialEnzymeDecomposition`, `Level 2`)**: couples substrate pools $S_i$ [g C m$^{-2}$] to active microbial biomass $M_{\\mathrm{mic}}$ [g C m$^{-2}$] with carbon-use efficiency $\\mathrm{CUE} \\in (0, 1)$:"
msgstr "**逆米氏微生物-胞外酶动力学（`MicrobialEnzymeDecomposition`，`Level 2`）**：在碳利用效率 $\\mathrm{CUE} \\in (0, 1)$ 下，将底物碳库 $S_i$ [g C m$^{-2}$] 与活性微生物生物量 $M_{\\mathrm{mic}}$ [g C m$^{-2}$] 相耦合："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:84
msgid "V_i = \\frac{M_{\\mathrm{mic}}\\,V_{\\max,i}(T, \\theta)\\,S_i}{K_{m,i}(T) + M_{\\mathrm{mic}}}, \\qquad \\frac{\\mathrm{d}M_{\\mathrm{mic}}}{\\mathrm{d}t} = \\mathrm{CUE}\\sum_i V_i - D_{\\mathrm{mic}}, \\qquad R_{\\mathrm{microbial}} = (1 - \\mathrm{CUE})\\sum_i V_i + D_{\\mathrm{mic}},"
msgstr "V_i = \\frac{M_{\\mathrm{mic}}\\,V_{\\max,i}(T, \\theta)\\,S_i}{K_{m,i}(T) + M_{\\mathrm{mic}}}, \\qquad \\frac{\\mathrm{d}M_{\\mathrm{mic}}}{\\mathrm{d}t} = \\mathrm{CUE}\\sum_i V_i - D_{\\mathrm{mic}}, \\qquad R_{\\mathrm{microbial}} = (1 - \\mathrm{CUE})\\sum_i V_i + D_{\\mathrm{mic}},"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:86
msgid "where $D_{\\mathrm{mic}} = (\\tau_{\\mathrm{turn}} + \\tau_{\\mathrm{maint}}f_T)M_{\\mathrm{mic}}$ so $\\sum_i \\Delta S_i + \\Delta M_{\\mathrm{mic}} + R_{\\mathrm{microbial}}\\Delta t = 0$ prior to external litter addition."
msgstr "其中 $D_{\\mathrm{mic}} = (\\tau_{\\mathrm{turn}} + \\tau_{\\mathrm{maint}}f_T)M_{\\mathrm{mic}}$，使得在计入外源凋落物输入之前满足 $\\sum_i \\Delta S_i + \\Delta M_{\\mathrm{mic}} + R_{\\mathrm{microbial}}\\Delta t = 0$。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:90
msgid "Litterfall and hydrological chain maps"
msgstr "凋落物与水文链映射"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:92
msgid "`LitterfallInterfaceMapper` (`Level 2`) partitions plant litter and livestock dung inputs onto metabolic and structural litter ports while preserving total C and N mass: $F_{\\mathrm{met,C}} + F_{\\mathrm{str,C}} = F_{\\mathrm{plant,C}} + F_{\\mathrm{dung,C}}$ and $F_{\\mathrm{org,N}} = F_{\\mathrm{plant,N}} + F_{\\mathrm{dung,N}}$. `PedosphereInterfaceMapper` (`Level 2`) projects hydrological boundary fluxes (infiltration, evapotranspiration, drainage) onto pedosphere port names via the identity chain map $\\mathbf{y}_h = I_3\\mathbf{x}_h$ (`REPLACE`) without recomputing hydrological closures."
msgstr "`LitterfallInterfaceMapper`（`Level 2`）将植物凋落物与牲畜粪便输入分配至代谢性与结构性凋落物端口，同时严格保持碳、氮总质量守恒：$F_{\\mathrm{met,C}} + F_{\\mathrm{str,C}} = F_{\\mathrm{plant,C}} + F_{\\mathrm{dung,C}}$ 且 $F_{\\mathrm{org,N}} = F_{\\mathrm{plant,N}} + F_{\\mathrm{dung,N}}$。`PedosphereInterfaceMapper`（`Level 2`）通过恒等链映射 $\\mathbf{y}_h = I_3\\mathbf{x}_h$（`REPLACE`）将水文边界通量（入渗、蒸散发、排水）投影至土壤圈端口名称，不重复计算水文闭合方程。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:102
msgid "Soil nitrogen, root P uptake, and C:N stoichiometry boundaries"
msgstr "土壤氮循环、根系磷吸收与碳氮化学计量边界"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:104
msgid "Mineralization, nitrification, denitrification, aggregation, and leaching"
msgstr "矿化、硝化、反硝化、聚合与淋溶"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:106
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Mineralization and immobilization (`MineralizationProcess`, `Level 2`)**: bounds gross organic-N mineralization and microbial $\\mathrm{NH_4^+}$ immobilization against available stocks over $\\Delta t$:"
msgstr "**矿化与固持（`MineralizationProcess`，`Level 2`）**：在时间步 $\\Delta t$ 内以可用氮库储量约束有机氮总矿化速率与微生物 $\\mathrm{NH_4^+}$ 固持速率："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:110
msgid "R_{\\mathrm{gross}} = \\min\\!\\left(k_{\\min} N_{\\mathrm{org}} f_{\\mathrm{env}},\\; \\frac{N_{\\mathrm{org}}}{\\Delta t}\\right), \\qquad R_{\\mathrm{immob}} = \\min\\!\\left(\\frac{\\mathrm{CUE}\\cdot \\mathrm{DEC}}{\\mathrm{CN}_{\\mathrm{mic}}\\,\\eta_N},\\; \\frac{N_{\\mathrm{NH_4}}}{\\Delta t}\\right),"
msgstr "R_{\\mathrm{gross}} = \\min\\!\\left(k_{\\min} N_{\\mathrm{org}} f_{\\mathrm{env}},\\; \\frac{N_{\\mathrm{org}}}{\\Delta t}\\right), \\qquad R_{\\mathrm{immob}} = \\min\\!\\left(\\frac{\\mathrm{CUE}\\cdot \\mathrm{DEC}}{\\mathrm{CN}_{\\mathrm{mic}}\\,\\eta_N},\\; \\frac{N_{\\mathrm{NH_4}}}{\\Delta t}\\right),"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:112
msgid "preserving $\\Delta N_{\\mathrm{org}} + \\Delta N_{\\mathrm{NH_4}} + \\Delta N_{\\mathrm{mic}} = 0$ on internal transformations."
msgstr "在内部氮转化过程中保持 $\\Delta N_{\\mathrm{org}} + \\Delta N_{\\mathrm{NH_4}} + \\Delta N_{\\mathrm{mic}} = 0$。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:115
msgid "**Nitrification (`NitrificationProcess`, `Level 2`) and denitrification (`DenitrificationProcess`, `Level 2`)**: both consume `water_filled_pore_space` $W \\in [0, 1]$ (Linn and Doran, 1984; Del Grosso et al., 2000) under documented RELIC piecewise-linear oxygen and anaerobic ramps ($W_{\\mathrm{opt}} = W_{\\mathrm{thr}} = 0.6$, minimum floor $0.1$):"
msgstr "**硝化（`NitrificationProcess`，`Level 2`）与反硝化（`DenitrificationProcess`，`Level 2`）**：二者均读取 `water_filled_pore_space` $W \\in [0, 1]$（Linn and Doran, 1984；Del Grosso et al., 2000），并采用已归档的 RELIC 分段线性好氧与厌氧斜坡函数（$W_{\\mathrm{opt}} = W_{\\mathrm{thr}} = 0.6$，下界底值 $0.1$）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:120
msgid "r_{\\mathrm{nit}} = V_{\\max,\\mathrm{nit}}\\,\\frac{N_{\\mathrm{NH_4}}}{K_{m,\\mathrm{NH_4}} + N_{\\mathrm{NH_4}}}\\,f_T\\,f_{\\mathrm{pH}}\\,f_{\\mathrm{O_2}}(W), \\qquad r_{\\mathrm{denit}} = V_{\\max,\\mathrm{denit}}\\,\\frac{N_{\\mathrm{NO_3}}}{K_{m,\\mathrm{NO_3}} + N_{\\mathrm{NO_3}}}\\,f_{\\mathrm{anaer}}(W)\\,f_C\\,f_T\\,f_{\\mathrm{pH}},"
msgstr "r_{\\mathrm{nit}} = V_{\\max,\\mathrm{nit}}\\,\\frac{N_{\\mathrm{NH_4}}}{K_{m,\\mathrm{NH_4}} + N_{\\mathrm{NH_4}}}\\,f_T\\,f_{\\mathrm{pH}}\\,f_{\\mathrm{O_2}}(W), \\qquad r_{\\mathrm{denit}} = V_{\\max,\\mathrm{denit}}\\,\\frac{N_{\\mathrm{NO_3}}}{K_{m,\\mathrm{NO_3}} + N_{\\mathrm{NO_3}}}\\,f_{\\mathrm{anaer}}(W)\\,f_C\\,f_T\\,f_{\\mathrm{pH}},"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:122
msgid "closing local nitrogen mass ledgers $\\Delta N_{\\mathrm{NH_4}} + \\Delta N_{\\mathrm{NO_3}} + \\Delta N_{\\mathrm{N_2O,nit}} = 0$ and $\\Delta N_{\\mathrm{NO_3}} + \\Delta N_{\\mathrm{N_2O,denit}} + \\Delta N_{\\mathrm{N_2}} = 0$."
msgstr "分别闭合局地氮质量账本 $\\Delta N_{\\mathrm{NH_4}} + \\Delta N_{\\mathrm{NO_3}} + \\Delta N_{\\mathrm{N_2O,nit}} = 0$ 与 $\\Delta N_{\\mathrm{NO_3}} + \\Delta N_{\\mathrm{N_2O,denit}} + \\Delta N_{\\mathrm{N_2}} = 0$。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:126
msgid "**Diagnostic N aggregation (`NitrogenCycling`, `Level 2`) and retarded leaching (`NitrogenLeachingProcess`, `Level 3`)**: `NitrogenCycling` aggregates child process rates diagnostically without re-running child kinetics and commits only the external fertilizer-plus-urine ammonium increment $\\Delta N_{\\mathrm{NH_4,ext}} = 1000(F_{\\mathrm{fert}} + F_{\\mathrm{urine}})\\Delta t$ via `UpdateItem(ACCUMULATE, per_timestep=True)`. `NitrogenLeachingProcess` computes drainage-driven export from mobile retarded nitrate concentration $C_{\\mathrm{NO_3,mob}} = \\frac{N_{\\mathrm{NO_3}}/(\\theta z_s)}{1 + \\rho_b K_d / \\theta}$ and water drainage $F_w$, bounded by pool availability and minimum depletion timescale so $\\Delta N_{\\mathrm{NO_3}} + F_{N,\\mathrm{leach}}\\Delta t = 0$."
msgstr "**诊断性氮聚合（`NitrogenCycling`，`Level 2`）与阻滞淋溶（`NitrogenLeachingProcess`，`Level 3`）**：`NitrogenCycling` 仅对子过程速率做诊断性汇总，不重复运行子过程动力学，并仅通过 `UpdateItem(ACCUMULATE, per_timestep=True)` 提交外源施肥与尿液铵态氮增量 $\\Delta N_{\\mathrm{NH_4,ext}} = 1000(F_{\\mathrm{fert}} + F_{\\mathrm{urine}})\\Delta t$。`NitrogenLeachingProcess` 由流动相阻滞硝态氮浓度 $C_{\\mathrm{NO_3,mob}} = \\frac{N_{\\mathrm{NO_3}}/(\\theta z_s)}{1 + \\rho_b K_d / \\theta}$ 与水分排水通量 $F_w$ 计算排水驱动的淋溶输出，并受可用氮库与最小耗竭时间尺度约束，从而满足 $\\Delta N_{\\mathrm{NO_3}} + F_{N,\\mathrm{leach}}\\Delta t = 0$。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:136
msgid "Root N and P uptake and C:N diagnostic scope"
msgstr "根系氮磷吸收与 C:N 诊断范围"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:138
msgid "`relic.scientific.pedosphere.nutrient_cycling.root_nutrient_uptake.RootNutrientUptake` (`Level 2`) evaluates layered Michaelis-Menten root uptake $U_i(z) = V_{\\max,i}\\frac{C_i(z)}{K_{m,i} + C_i(z)} f_T f_W W_{\\mathrm{root}}(z)$ (Barber, 1995) for $\\mathrm{NO_3^-}$, $\\mathrm{NH_4^+}$, and dissolved phosphorus. Molar plant nitrogen storage $S_N$ [mol N m$^{-2}$] and gram-basis soil pools $m_{\\mathrm{NO_3}}, m_{\\mathrm{NH_4}}$ [g N m$^{-2}$] close via $(\\Delta m_{\\mathrm{NO_3}} + \\Delta m_{\\mathrm{NH_4}})/M_N + \\Delta S_N = 0$. Realized molar phosphorus uptake rate $U_P$ [mol P m$^{-2}$ s$^{-1}$] is bounded by a four-way minimum over kinetic uptake capacity $U_{P,\\mathrm{kin}}$, plant demand $D_P$, available labile soil phosphorus $P_{\\mathrm{avail}}$ [g P m$^{-2}$], and remaining plant P storage capacity $P_{\\mathrm{cap,mol}}$ [mol P m$^{-2}$]:"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.pedosphere.nutrient_cycling.root_nutrient_uptake.RootNutrientUptake`（`Level 2`）依据分层米氏动力学 $U_i(z) = V_{\\max,i}\\frac{C_i(z)}{K_{m,i} + C_i(z)} f_T f_W W_{\\mathrm{root}}(z)$（Barber, 1995）计算根系对 $\\mathrm{NO_3^-}$、$\\mathrm{NH_4^+}$ 及溶解态磷的吸收。摩尔基准植物氮库 $S_N$ [mol N m$^{-2}$] 与质量基准土壤无机氮库 $m_{\\mathrm{NO_3}}, m_{\\mathrm{NH_4}}$ [g N m$^{-2}$] 通过 $(\\Delta m_{\\mathrm{NO_3}} + \\Delta m_{\\mathrm{NH_4}})/M_N + \\Delta S_N = 0$ 闭合。实际实现的摩尔磷吸收速率 $U_P$ [mol P m$^{-2}$ s$^{-1}$] 由动力学吸收能力 $U_{P,\\mathrm{kin}}$、植物磷需求 $D_P$、土壤有效活性磷 $P_{\\mathrm{avail}}$ [g P m$^{-2}$] 以及植物剩余储磷容量 $P_{\\mathrm{cap,mol}}$ [mol P m$^{-2}$] 的四重极小值定界："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:150
msgid ""
"\n"
"U_P = \\min\\!\\left(U_{P,\\mathrm{kin}},\\; D_P,\\; \\frac{P_{\\mathrm{avail}}}{M_P\\,\\Delta t},\\; \\frac{P_{\\mathrm{cap,mol}}}{\\Delta t}\\right),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\Delta P_{\\mathrm{avail}} + \\Delta P_{\\mathrm{plant}} = 0.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"U_P = \\min\\!\\left(U_{P,\\mathrm{kin}},\\; D_P,\\; \\frac{P_{\\mathrm{avail}}}{M_P\\,\\Delta t},\\; \\frac{P_{\\mathrm{cap,mol}}}{\\Delta t}\\right),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\Delta P_{\\mathrm{avail}} + \\Delta P_{\\mathrm{plant}} = 0.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:156
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Phosphorus and stoichiometry scope boundary**: `RootNutrientUptake` (together with managed phosphate delivery from `FertilizationManagement` and foliar N:P limitation in `NutrientStress`) constitutes the implemented `[I]` phosphorus interface. Standalone multi-pool soil phosphorus weathering, occlusion, mineralization, and P-leaching Functors remain `[N]`. Separately, `relic.scientific.pedosphere.nutrient_cycling.stoichiometry.StoichiometryConstraint` (`Level 1`, `ScaleCouplingFunctor`) is a read-only C:N flux-ratio and mass-balance diagnostic observer ($\\Delta \\mathbf{x} = \\mathbf{0}$); it neither projects state onto a stoichiometric manifold nor audits phosphorus pools."
msgstr "**磷循环与化学计量范围边界**：`RootNutrientUptake`（配合 `FertilizationManagement` 的管理施磷输入以及 `NutrientStress` 的叶片 N:P 限制标量）共同构成已实现 `[I]` 的磷接口；独立的多库土壤磷风化、闭蓄态转化、有机磷矿化及磷淋溶算子当前保持 `[N]` 状态。此外，`relic.scientific.pedosphere.nutrient_cycling.stoichiometry.StoichiometryConstraint`（`Level 1`，`ScaleCouplingFunctor`）属于只读 C:N 通量比与质量平衡诊断观测算子（$\\Delta \\mathbf{x} = \\mathbf{0}$），既不将状态投影至化学计量流形，也不审计磷库。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:166
msgid "Wetland methane request-and-coupler architecture"
msgstr "湿地甲烷请求-耦合器架构"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:168
#, python-brace-format
msgid "To prevent competing storage clamps across methanogenesis, methanotrophy, and three-pathway gas escape, RELIC separates wetland $\\mathrm{CH_4}$ into three stateless tendency/request Functors, one prognostic budget owner, and one diagnostic scale-routing observer:"
msgstr "为避免产甲烷、甲烷氧化与三通道气体逸出之间出现相互竞争的库存截断，RELIC 将湿地 $\\mathrm{CH_4}$ 拆分为三个无状态倾向/请求算子、一个预报收支归属算子以及一个诊断性尺度路由观测算子："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:173
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Production request (`MethaneProductionFunctor`, `Level 2`)**: blends the iMAPLE inundation branch (Yue et al., 2024, Eq. 34) and a redox-gated calibrated branch with gating weight $w \\in [0, 1]$ and peaked temperature response $f_{ST}(T)$ (Zhu et al., 2014):"
msgstr "**产生请求（`MethaneProductionFunctor`，`Level 2`）**：以门控权重 $w \\in [0, 1]$ 与带峰值的温度响应函数 $f_{ST}(T)$（Zhu et al., 2014）加权融合 iMAPLE 淹水分支（Yue et al., 2024, Eq. 34）与氧化还原门控率定分支："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:178
msgid "P_{\\mathrm{CH_4}} = (1 - w)\\,R_h r f_{ST}(T) f_{\\mathrm{pH}} f_{\\mathrm{wet}} + w\\,R_h r f_{ST}(T) f_{Eh}(Eh)\\,A."
msgstr "P_{\\mathrm{CH_4}} = (1 - w)\\,R_h r f_{ST}(T) f_{\\mathrm{pH}} f_{\\mathrm{wet}} + w\\,R_h r f_{ST}(T) f_{Eh}(Eh)\\,A."

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:180
msgid "**Oxidation request (`MethaneOxidationFunctor`, `Level 2`)**: evaluates dual Michaelis-Menten kinetics in porewater $\\mathrm{CH_4}$ and $\\mathrm{O_2}$ concentrations (Riley et al., 2011, Eq. 7; Oleson et al., 2013, Eq. 19.11), bounded by $M_{\\mathrm{CH_4}}/\\Delta t$."
msgstr "**氧化请求（`MethaneOxidationFunctor`，`Level 2`）**：基于孔隙水 $\\mathrm{CH_4}$ 与 $\\mathrm{O_2}$ 浓度计算双底物米氏动力学（Riley et al., 2011, Eq. 7；Oleson et al., 2013, Eq. 19.11），并以 $M_{\\mathrm{CH_4}}/\\Delta t$ 为上界。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:185
msgid "**Three-pathway transport request (`MethaneTransportFunctor`, `Level 3`)**: sums aqueous-gaseous molecular diffusion $F_{\\mathrm{diff}}$, threshold ebullition $F_{\\mathrm{ebull}}$, and aerenchyma plant-mediated venting $F_{\\mathrm{plant}}$ (Walter and Heimann, 2000) into $F_{\\mathrm{req}} = F_{\\mathrm{diff}} + F_{\\mathrm{ebull}} + F_{\\mathrm{plant}}$ and $T_{\\mathrm{trans}} = -F_{\\mathrm{req}}$ (`REPLACE`)."
msgstr "**三通道输运请求（`MethaneTransportFunctor`，`Level 3`）**：将液-气分子扩散 $F_{\\mathrm{diff}}$、阈值气泡逸出 $F_{\\mathrm{ebull}}$ 与通气组织植物介导排放 $F_{\\mathrm{plant}}$（Walter and Heimann, 2000）求和为 $F_{\\mathrm{req}} = F_{\\mathrm{diff}} + F_{\\mathrm{ebull}} + F_{\\mathrm{plant}}$ 及 $T_{\\mathrm{trans}} = -F_{\\mathrm{req}}$（`REPLACE`）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:192
msgid "**Single realization owner (`MethaneBudgetCoupler`, `Level 2`)**: integrates combined tendencies $\\Delta M_{\\mathrm{raw}} = (T_{\\mathrm{prod}} + T_{\\mathrm{oxid}} + T_{\\mathrm{trans}})\\Delta t$, enforces non-negativity once via $\\Delta M = \\max(\\Delta M_{\\mathrm{raw}}, -M_{\\mathrm{CH_4}})$, commits $\\Delta M$ to `ch4_soil_storage` (`ACCUMULATE`, `per_timestep=True`), and deducts any storage-limiter deficit $R_{\\mathrm{lim}} = (\\Delta M - \\Delta M_{\\mathrm{raw}})/\\Delta t$ from realized atmospheric emission $F_{\\mathrm{atm}} = F_{\\mathrm{req}} - R_{\\mathrm{lim}}$ so $\\Delta M + (O - P_{\\mathrm{CH_4}} + F_{\\mathrm{atm}})\\Delta t = 0$. `MethaneScaleCouplingFunctor` (`Level 1`) computes the bounded diagnostic routing weight $w_{\\mathrm{DNDC}} = \\operatorname{clip}(\\alpha_{\\mathrm{wet}}f_{\\mathrm{wet}} + \\alpha_{\\mathrm{wfps}}W + \\alpha_{\\mathrm{data}}s_{\\mathrm{data}} - \\tau,\\; 0,\\; 1)$."
msgstr "**唯一收支实现算子（`MethaneBudgetCoupler`，`Level 2`）**：积分合成总倾向 $\\Delta M_{\\mathrm{raw}} = (T_{\\mathrm{prod}} + T_{\\mathrm{oxid}} + T_{\\mathrm{trans}})\\Delta t$，通过 $\\Delta M = \\max(\\Delta M_{\\mathrm{raw}}, -M_{\\mathrm{CH_4}})$ 一次性施加非负约束，将 $\\Delta M$ 提交至 `ch4_soil_storage`（`ACCUMULATE`，`per_timestep=True`），并从实际大气排放通量中扣除库存限制亏缺 $R_{\\mathrm{lim}} = (\\Delta M - \\Delta M_{\\mathrm{raw}})/\\Delta t$，即 $F_{\\mathrm{atm}} = F_{\\mathrm{req}} - R_{\\mathrm{lim}}$，从而严格满足 $\\Delta M + (O - P_{\\mathrm{CH_4}} + F_{\\mathrm{atm}})\\Delta t = 0$。`MethaneScaleCouplingFunctor`（`Level 1`）计算有界诊断路由权重 $w_{\\mathrm{DNDC}} = \\operatorname{clip}(\\alpha_{\\mathrm{wet}}f_{\\mathrm{wet}} + \\alpha_{\\mathrm{wfps}}W + \\alpha_{\\mathrm{data}}s_{\\mathrm{data}} - \\tau,\\; 0,\\; 1)$。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:202
msgid "Porous-media water, gas, solute, DAE, ALE, and memory transport"
msgstr "多孔介质水分、气体、溶质、DAE、ALE 与记忆核输运"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:204
msgid "Richards water, Millington-Quirk gas diffusion, and retarded solute transport"
msgstr "Richards 水分运动、Millington-Quirk 气体扩散与阻滞溶质输运"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:206
msgid "`SoilWaterTransportFunctor` (`Level 3`) solves the 1D mixed Richards balance $\\partial_t \\theta = -\\partial_z q + S$ with $q = -K(\\theta)\\partial_z(h + z)$ in discrete cochain form $\\dot{\\boldsymbol{\\theta}}_h = -D_h \\mathbf{q}_h + G_h \\mathbf{u}_h$ ($\\star_K = \\star_K^{\\mathsf{T}} \\succeq 0$), emitting full next-state `soil_moisture` via `REPLACE`."
msgstr "`SoilWaterTransportFunctor`（`Level 3`）以离散上链形式 $\\dot{\\boldsymbol{\\theta}}_h = -D_h \\mathbf{q}_h + G_h \\mathbf{u}_h$（$\\star_K = \\star_K^{\\mathsf{T}} \\succeq 0$）求解一维混合形式 Richards 方程 $\\partial_t \\theta = -\\partial_z q + S$（其中 $q = -K(\\theta)\\partial_z(h + z)$），并通过 `REPLACE` 输出完整下一时刻 `soil_moisture`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:211
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`GasDiffusion1D` (`Level 3`) diffuses vadose $\\mathrm{CO_2}$-C and $\\mathrm{N_2O}$-N profiles under Millington and Quirk (1961) tortuosity above a no-flux lower boundary (`ACCUMULATE` concentration increments, `REPLACE` surface efflux)."
msgstr "`GasDiffusion1D`（`Level 3`）在零通量下边界之上，依据 Millington and Quirk (1961) 弯曲度系数计算包气带 $\\mathrm{CO_2}$-C 与 $\\mathrm{N_2O}$-N 剖面扩散（浓度增量采用 `ACCUMULATE`，地表逸出通量采用 `REPLACE`）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:215
msgid "`SoluteAdvectionDiffusion1D` (`Level 3`) solves 1D retarded advection-dispersion $\\partial_t\\left((\\theta + \\rho_b K_d)C\\right) = -\\partial_z\\left(q C - K_{\\mathrm{disp}}\\partial_z C\\right)$ for $\\mathrm{NO_3^-}$-N and DOC-C, verifying $M^{n+1} - M^n - (F_{\\mathrm{top}} - F_{\\mathrm{bot}})\\Delta t = 0$."
msgstr "`SoluteAdvectionDiffusion1D`（`Level 3`）针对 $\\mathrm{NO_3^-}$-N 与 DOC-C 求解一维阻滞平流-弥散方程 $\\partial_t\\left((\\theta + \\rho_b K_d)C\\right) = -\\partial_z\\left(q C - K_{\\mathrm{disp}}\\partial_z C\\right)$，并校验质量平衡 $M^{n+1} - M^n - (F_{\\mathrm{top}} - F_{\\mathrm{bot}})\\Delta t = 0$。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:220
msgid "Freundlich equilibrium-sorption index-1 descriptor DAE (`EquilibriumSorptionFunctor`, Level 2)"
msgstr "Freundlich 平衡吸附指标-1 描述符 DAE（`EquilibriumSorptionFunctor`，Level 2）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:222
msgid "`relic.scientific.pedosphere.transport.equilibrium_sorption.EquilibriumSorptionFunctor` (`Level 2`, `PhysicalFieldFunctor`) formulates nonlinear Freundlich equilibrium sorption $S = K_f C^n$ ($n \\in [0.3, 1.0]$) with first-order dissolved-phase degradation rate $\\lambda \\ge 0$ (Jury and Horton, 2004; Mayes et al., 2012; Hairer and Wanner, 1996) as a semi-explicit index-1 descriptor DAE $E\\dot{\\mathbf{x}} = \\mathbf{f}(\\mathbf{x})$, $\\mathbf{g}(\\mathbf{x}) = \\mathbf{0}$ on $\\mathbf{x} = (y, C, S)^{\\mathsf{T}}$ with $E = \\operatorname{diag}(1, 0, 0)$:"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.pedosphere.transport.equilibrium_sorption.EquilibriumSorptionFunctor`（`Level 2`，`PhysicalFieldFunctor`）将非线性 Freundlich 平衡吸附 $S = K_f C^n$（$n \\in [0.3, 1.0]$）与溶解相一级降解速率 $\\lambda \\ge 0$（Jury and Horton, 2004；Mayes et al., 2012；Hairer and Wanner, 1996）表述为状态向量 $\\mathbf{x} = (y, C, S)^{\\mathsf{T}}$ 与描述符矩阵 $E = \\operatorname{diag}(1, 0, 0)$ 上的半显式指标-1 描述符 DAE：$E\\dot{\\mathbf{x}} = \\mathbf{f}(\\mathbf{x})$，$\\mathbf{g}(\\mathbf{x}) = \\mathbf{0}$："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:230
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}t} = -\\lambda\\,\\theta\\,C,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"g_1(y, C, S) = \\theta C + \\rho_b S - y = 0,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"g_2(C, S) = S - K_f C^n = 0.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}t} = -\\lambda\\,\\theta\\,C,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"g_1(y, C, S) = \\theta C + \\rho_b S - y = 0,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"g_2(C, S) = S - K_f C^n = 0.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:238
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Because $\\partial_C(\\theta C + \\rho_b K_f C^n - y) = \\theta + \\rho_b K_f n C^{n-1} > 0$ for $\\theta > 0$ and $C > 0$, the algebraic Jacobian is strictly positive (differentiation index 1). At every step (including post-checkpoint restart validation of the stored $(y, C, S)$ triple), implicit backward-Euler elimination solves the strictly monotone scalar equation"
msgstr "由于当 $\\theta > 0$ 且 $C > 0$ 时 $\\partial_C(\\theta C + \\rho_b K_f C^n - y) = \\theta + \\rho_b K_f n C^{n-1} > 0$，代数雅可比恒为严格正值（微分指标为 1）。在每一时间步（含检查点重启后对已存储三元组 $(y, C, S)$ 的一致性校验），隐式向后欧拉消元求解如下严格单调标量方程"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:244
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"F(C') = \\theta(1 + \\lambda\\,\\Delta t)C' + \\rho_b K_f (C')^n - y = 0,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"C' \\in \\left[0,\\; \\frac{y}{\\theta}\\right],\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"F(C') = \\theta(1 + \\lambda\\,\\Delta t)C' + \\rho_b K_f (C')^n - y = 0,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"C' \\in \\left[0,\\; \\frac{y}{\\theta}\\right],\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:250
msgid "via `relic.computation.solvers.nonlinear.BracketedBisectionSolver`, updates differential total mass $y' = y - \\lambda\\,\\theta\\,C'\\Delta t$ via `UpdateItem(ACCUMULATE, per_timestep=True)`, and replaces algebraic states $C'$ and $S' = K_f (C')^n$ (`REPLACE`), reporting the post-step manifold residual $\\lvert \\theta C' + \\rho_b S' - y' \\rvert$."
msgstr "该方程由 `relic.computation.solvers.nonlinear.BracketedBisectionSolver` 求解，随后通过 `UpdateItem(ACCUMULATE, per_timestep=True)` 更新微分总质量 $y' = y - \\lambda\\,\\theta\\,C'\\Delta t$，通过 `REPLACE` 替换代数状态 $C'$ 与 $S' = K_f (C')^n$，并输出步后流形残差 $\\lvert \\theta C' + \\rho_b S' - y' \\rvert$。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:256
msgid "1D ALE moving-domain diffusion and exact GCL (`MovingDomainDiffusionFunctor`, Level 3)"
msgstr "一维 ALE 移动域扩散与精确 GCL（`MovingDomainDiffusionFunctor`，Level 3）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:258
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`relic.scientific.pedosphere.transport.moving_domain_diffusion.MovingDomainDiffusionFunctor` (`Level 3`, `TransportMechanismFunctor`) solves Fickian solute diffusion on a uniformly stretching or compressing 1D column $x(\\xi, t) = \\xi L(t)$, $\\xi \\in [0, 1]$, driven by lower-boundary velocity $w_b$ [m s$^{-1}$] (Thomas and Lombard, 1979; Donea et al., 2004). With $N$ uniform cells of thickness $V_i(t) = \\Delta x(t) = L(t)/N$ and face velocities $w_k = (k/N)w_b$ ($k = 0, \\dots, N$), the discrete Geometric Conservation Law (GCL) holds identically:"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.pedosphere.transport.moving_domain_diffusion.MovingDomainDiffusionFunctor`（`Level 3`，`TransportMechanismFunctor`）在下边界速度 $w_b$ [m s$^{-1}$] 驱动的均匀拉伸或压缩一维土柱 $x(\\xi, t) = \\xi L(t)$（$\\xi \\in [0, 1]$）上求解 Fick 溶质扩散（Thomas and Lombard, 1979；Donea et al., 2004）。设共有 $N$ 个均匀网格单元，单元厚度为 $V_i(t) = \\Delta x(t) = L(t)/N$，界面速度为 $w_k = (k/N)w_b$（$k = 0, \\dots, N$），离散几何守恒律（GCL）恒等成立："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:267
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"V_i(t + \\Delta t) - V_i(t) = \\Delta t\\,(w_{i+1} - w_i) = \\frac{w_b\\,\\Delta t}{N},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"L(t + \\Delta t) = L(t) + w_b\\,\\Delta t.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"V_i(t + \\Delta t) - V_i(t) = \\Delta t\\,(w_{i+1} - w_i) = \\frac{w_b\\,\\Delta t}{N},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"L(t + \\Delta t) = L(t) + w_b\\,\\Delta t.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:273
msgid "Subject to both diffusive Von Neumann and mesh-Courant ($\\lvert w_b \\rvert \\Delta t / \\Delta x \\le \\mathrm{CFL}_{\\mathrm{mesh,max}}$) bounds, cell solute mass $m_i = V_i c_i$ advances by zero-flux interior diffusion plus upwind relative swept-face fluxes $s_k = c_{\\mathrm{face},k} w_k$ (entraining exterior concentration $c_b$ when $w_b > 0$ and exporting bottom-cell $c_{N-1}$ when $w_b < 0$):"
msgstr "在同时满足扩散冯·诺依曼稳定性判据与网格 Courant 条件（$\\lvert w_b \\rvert \\Delta t / \\Delta x \\le \\mathrm{CFL}_{\\mathrm{mesh,max}}$）下，单元溶质质量 $m_i = V_i c_i$ 由零通量边界内部扩散与迎风相对扫掠界面通量 $s_k = c_{\\mathrm{face},k} w_k$ 共同推进（当 $w_b > 0$ 时卷吸外部浓度 $c_b$，当 $w_b < 0$ 时输出底层单元浓度 $c_{N-1}$）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:279
msgid ""
"\n"
"m_i(t + \\Delta t) = m_i(t) + \\Delta t\\left(r_{\\mathrm{diff},i}\\,\\Delta x(t) + s_{i+1} - s_i\\right),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"c_i(t + \\Delta t) = \\frac{m_i(t + \\Delta t)}{V_i(t + \\Delta t)}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"m_i(t + \\Delta t) = m_i(t) + \\Delta t\\left(r_{\\mathrm{diff},i}\\,\\Delta x(t) + s_{i+1} - s_i\\right),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"c_i(t + \\Delta t) = \\frac{m_i(t + \\Delta t)}{V_i(t + \\Delta t)}.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:285
msgid "On the time-dependent Hodge metric $\\star(t) = \\operatorname{diag}(L(t)/N)$ with quadratic storage $H = \\frac{1}{2}\\mathbf{c}^{\\mathsf{T}}\\star(t)\\mathbf{c}$ and $\\dot{\\star} = \\operatorname{diag}(w_b / N)$, the moving-geometry power term $-\\frac{1}{2}\\mathbf{c}^{\\mathsf{T}}\\dot{\\star}\\mathbf{c}$ is emitted explicitly in `diagnostics.moving_domain.geometry_power` alongside `gcl_residual` and `mass_balance_residual`."
msgstr "在含时 Hodge 度量 $\\star(t) = \\operatorname{diag}(L(t)/N)$、二次储能泛函 $H = \\frac{1}{2}\\mathbf{c}^{\\mathsf{T}}\\star(t)\\mathbf{c}$ 与 $\\dot{\\star} = \\operatorname{diag}(w_b / N)$ 下，移动几何功率项 $-\\frac{1}{2}\\mathbf{c}^{\\mathsf{T}}\\dot{\\star}\\mathbf{c}$ 与 `gcl_residual`、`mass_balance_residual` 一并显式输出于 `diagnostics.moving_domain.geometry_power`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:292
msgid "Mobile-immobile exact exponential memory exchange (`TwoRegionMassTransferFunctor`, Level 3)"
msgstr "流动-不动双区精确指数记忆核交换（`TwoRegionMassTransferFunctor`，Level 3）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:294
msgid "`relic.scientific.pedosphere.transport.two_region_mass_transfer.TwoRegionMassTransferFunctor` (`Level 3`, `TransportMechanismFunctor`) implements first-order mass transfer of rate $\\alpha > 0$ [s$^{-1}$] between mobile ($\\theta_m, c_m$) and stagnant immobile ($\\theta_{\\mathrm{im}}, c_{\\mathrm{im}}$) pore-water regions (van Genuchten and Wierenga, 1976; Haggerty and Gorelick, 1995). On the $\\theta$-weighted storage state $\\mathbf{x} = (\\theta_m c_m, \\theta_{\\mathrm{im}} c_{\\mathrm{im}})^{\\mathsf{T}}$ with quadratic free-energy proxy $H(\\mathbf{x}) = \\frac{1}{2}(\\theta_m c_m^2 + \\theta_{\\mathrm{im}} c_{\\mathrm{im}}^2)$ and conjugate effort $\\mathbf{e} = \\frac{\\partial H}{\\partial \\mathbf{x}} = (c_m, c_{\\mathrm{im}})^{\\mathsf{T}}$, the dynamics form a purely dissipative system ($J_h = 0$):"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.pedosphere.transport.two_region_mass_transfer.TwoRegionMassTransferFunctor`（`Level 3`，`TransportMechanismFunctor`）实现了流动孔隙水区（$\\theta_m, c_m$）与滞留不动孔隙水区（$\\theta_{\\mathrm{im}}, c_{\\mathrm{im}}$）之间速率系数为 $\\alpha > 0$ [s$^{-1}$] 的一级质量交换（van Genuchten and Wierenga, 1976；Haggerty and Gorelick, 1995）。在 $\\theta$ 加权储量状态 $\\mathbf{x} = (\\theta_m c_m, \\theta_{\\mathrm{im}} c_{\\mathrm{im}})^{\\mathsf{T}}$、二次自由能代理泛函 $H(\\mathbf{x}) = \\frac{1}{2}(\\theta_m c_m^2 + \\theta_{\\mathrm{im}} c_{\\mathrm{im}}^2)$ 与共轭势变量 $\\mathbf{e} = \\frac{\\partial H}{\\partial \\mathbf{x}} = (c_m, c_{\\mathrm{im}})^{\\mathsf{T}}$ 下，该动力学构成纯耗散系统（$J_h = 0$）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:305
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}\\mathbf{x}}{\\mathrm{d}t} = -R_h\\mathbf{e},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"R_h = \\alpha\n"
"\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"1 & -1 \\\\\n"
"-1 & 1\n"
"\\end{bmatrix} \\succeq 0,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}H}{\\mathrm{d}t} = -\\alpha(c_m - c_{\\mathrm{im}})^2 \\le 0.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}\\mathbf{x}}{\\mathrm{d}t} = -R_h\\mathbf{e},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"R_h = \\alpha\n"
"\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"1 & -1 \\\\\n"
"-1 & 1\n"
"\\end{bmatrix} \\succeq 0,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}H}{\\mathrm{d}t} = -\\alpha(c_m - c_{\\mathrm{im}})^2 \\le 0.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/pedosphere.md:317
msgid "Eliminating $c_{\\mathrm{im}}$ yields the passive exponential Volterra memory kernel $K(t) = \\alpha\\omega\\exp(-\\omega t)$ with $\\omega = \\alpha / \\theta_{\\mathrm{im}}$. Over each step $\\Delta t$, `TwoRegionMassTransferFunctor` advances the linear $2 \\times 2$ exchange analytically via its exact matrix exponential $c_m(t+\\Delta t) - c_{\\mathrm{im}}(t+\\Delta t) = (c_m(t) - c_{\\mathrm{im}}(t))\\exp(-\\kappa \\Delta t)$ with $\\kappa = \\alpha(\\theta_m^{-1} + \\theta_{\\mathrm{im}}^{-1})$, conserving total pore solute $\\theta_m \\Delta c_m + \\theta_{\\mathrm{im}}\\Delta c_{\\mathrm{im}} = 0$ to machine precision and declaring `relic.core.functor.SubFlowAccuracy.EXACT` on its state update."
msgstr "消去 $c_{\\mathrm{im}}$ 可得无源指数 Volterra 记忆核 $K(t) = \\alpha\\omega\\exp(-\\omega t)$（其中 $\\omega = \\alpha / \\theta_{\\mathrm{im}}$）。在每一时间步 $\\Delta t$ 内，`TwoRegionMassTransferFunctor` 通过精确矩阵指数 $c_m(t+\\Delta t) - c_{\\mathrm{im}}(t+\\Delta t) = (c_m(t) - c_{\\mathrm{im}}(t))\\exp(-\\kappa \\Delta t)$（其中 $\\kappa = \\alpha(\\theta_m^{-1} + \\theta_{\\mathrm{im}}^{-1})$）解析推进该 $2 \\times 2$ 线性交换系统，在机器精度上守恒孔隙总溶质 $\\theta_m \\Delta c_m + \\theta_{\\mathrm{im}}\\Delta c_{\\mathrm{im}} = 0$，并在状态更新记录中声明 `relic.core.functor.SubFlowAccuracy.EXACT`。"

